<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#0B0D10;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;background:#12151A;"><tr><td style="padding:16px 20px;background:#0B0D10;border-bottom:1px solid #2C3138;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><img src="https://peptrium.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_2644-cropped-300x300.png" width="30" height="30" alt="" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;"><span style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.3em;color:#E6E8EB;">PEPTRIUM</span></td><td style="text-align:right;font-size:11px;color:#7D848D;">Kurze Frage</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:30px 20px 22px;text-align:center;background:#12151A;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div style="text-align:left;"><div style="font-size:34px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:800;color:#FFF;letter-spacing:-.02em;">Noch Fragen<br><span style="color:#8E959E;">vor dem Bestellen?</span></div><div style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#A3A9B1;margin:12px 0 6px;">Viele zögern beim ersten Mal – das verstehen wir. Hier die häufigsten Fragen:</div></div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td width="40" valign="top" style="width:40px;padding:14px 0;"><div style="width:30px;height:30px;line-height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFFFFF;color:#0D0F12;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;text-align:center;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">1</div></td><td style="padding:14px 4px;text-align:left;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;border-bottom:1px solid #2C3138;"><div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#FFF;">Wie bezahle ich?</div><div style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#A3A9B1;margin-top:4px;">Per Vorkasse (Überweisung) oder Krypto. Nach Zahlungseingang geht dein Paket raus.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="40" valign="top" style="width:40px;padding:14px 0;"><div style="width:30px;height:30px;line-height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFFFFF;color:#0D0F12;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;text-align:center;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">2</div></td><td style="padding:14px 4px;text-align:left;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;border-bottom:1px solid #2C3138;"><div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#FFF;">Wie schnell kommt es an?</div><div style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#A3A9B1;margin-top:4px;">In der Regel innerhalb von 2 Werktagen per DHL, ab 150 € versandkostenfrei.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="40" valign="top" style="width:40px;padding:14px 0;"><div style="width:30px;height:30px;line-height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFFFFF;color:#0D0F12;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;text-align:center;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">3</div></td><td style="padding:14px 4px;text-align:left;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;border-bottom:1px solid #2C3138;"><div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#FFF;">Wie wird verpackt?</div><div style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#A3A9B1;margin-top:4px;">Neutral und diskret, ohne Hinweis auf den Inhalt.</div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 20px 26px;text-align:center;background:#12151A;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div style="border:1px solid #2C3138;background:#181C22;border-radius:18px;padding:20px 16px;"><div style="font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#FFF;margin-bottom:4px;">Frag uns direkt</div><div style="font-size:13px;color:#A3A9B1;margin-bottom:14px;">Wir antworten meist innerhalb weniger Stunden.</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td width="50%" style="padding-right:5px;"><a href="mailto:info@peptrium.com" style="display:block;background:#FFFFFF;color:#0D0F12;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;padding:13px 6px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;">✉️ E-Mail</a></td><td width="50%" style="padding-left:5px;"><a href="https://t.me/peptrium" style="display:block;background:#229ED9;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;padding:13px 6px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;">Telegram</a></td></tr></table></div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 20px 30px;background:#12151A;text-align:left;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div style="text-align:left;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#7D848D;margin-bottom:10px;">DEIN WARENKORB · [[contact.custom_properties.wk_summe]]</div><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td width="56" style="width:56px;padding-right:8px;"><img src="[[contact.custom_properties.wk_bild_1]]" width="48" height="48" alt="" style="display:block;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;border:0;background:#0D0F12;"></td><td width="56" style="width:56px;padding-right:8px;display:[[contact.custom_properties.wk_show_2]];"><img src="[[contact.custom_properties.wk_bild_2]]" width="48" height="48" alt="" style="display:block;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;border:0;background:#0D0F12;"></td><td width="56" style="width:56px;padding-right:8px;display:[[contact.custom_properties.wk_show_3]];"><img src="[[contact.custom_properties.wk_bild_3]]" width="48" height="48" alt="" style="display:block;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;border:0;background:#0D0F12;"></td></tr></table><div style="height:16px;"></div><a href="[[contact.custom_properties.wk_link]]" style="display:block;width:100%;margin:0 auto;box-sizing:border-box;background:#FFFFFF;color:#0D0F12;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;line-height:1.2;padding:15px 12px;border-radius:12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">Zum Warenkorb →</a></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 22px 10px;text-align:center;background:#12151A;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><a href="[[contact.custom_properties.wk_abmelden]]" style="font-size:11px;color:#7D848D;">Keine Warenkorb-Erinnerungen mehr</a></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 22px 32px;text-align:center;background:#12151A;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div style="height:1px;background:#2C3138;margin:0 0 24px;"></div><img src="https://peptrium.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_2644-cropped-300x300.png" width="54" height="54" alt="Peptrium" style="display:block;margin:0 auto;width:54px;height:54px;border:0;"><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.34em;padding-left:.34em;color:#E6E8EB;margin-top:6px;">PEPTRIUM</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#7D848D;margin-top:14px;line-height:1.6;">Alle Produkte ausschließlich für Laborforschungszwecke.<br>Nicht für den menschlichen oder veterinärmedizinischen Gebrauch.</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#7D848D;margin-top:14px;line-height:1.6;">Du bekommst diese Mail, weil du an der Kasse deine E-Mail-Adresse angegeben hast.<br><a href="[[unsubscribe_link]]" style="color:#7D848D;">Abmelden</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>